#ASSERT `Within how many days must I be given a copy of the notice of cessation` `as the owner` FALSE `an unasked person` EQUALS `does not arise for you`
#ASSERT `Within how many days must I be given a copy of the notice of cessation` `as the builder` `an unasked fact` `an unasked person` EQUALS `does not arise for you`
#ASSERT `Within how many days must I be given a copy of the notice of cessation` `as the occupier` `an unasked fact` `an unasked person` EQUALS `does not arise for you`

#ASSERT `Within how many days must I give the owner a copy of my notice of cessation` `as the builder` TRUE EQUALS days 7
#ASSERT `Within how many days must I give the owner a copy of my notice of cessation` `as the builder` FALSE EQUALS `does not arise for you`
#ASSERT `Within how many days must I give the owner a copy of my notice of cessation` `as the owner` `an unasked fact` EQUALS `does not arise for you`
#ASSERT `Within how many days must I give the owner a copy of my notice of cessation` `as the occupier` `an unasked fact` EQUALS `does not arise for you`

