#ASSERT `What is the most I can be fined for not giving the owner a copy of the notice of cessation` `as the builder` FALSE EQUALS `does not arise for you`
#ASSERT `What is the most I can be fined for not giving the owner a copy of the notice of cessation` `as the owner` `an unasked fact` EQUALS `does not arise for you`
