§§ `For everyone the Act can prosecute`

-- ss 9, 37, 41: $50 000 first, $75 000 second, $100 000 third or later, with 12 months' imprisonment from the third.
#ASSERT `What is the most I can be fined under ss 9, 37 or 41` `as the owner` 0 EQUALS amount 50000
#ASSERT `What is the most I can be fined under ss 9, 37 or 41` `as the builder` 1 EQUALS amount 75000
#ASSERT `What is the most I can be fined under ss 9, 37 or 41` `as the occupier` 3 EQUALS amount 100000
#ASSERT `What is the most I can be fined under ss 9, 37 or 41` `as the owner` 1 EQUALS amount (`What is the most I can be fined` 1)

#ASSERT `For how many months at most may I be imprisoned under ss 9, 37 or 41` `as the owner` 2 EQUALS months 12
#ASSERT `For how many months at most may I be imprisoned under ss 9, 37 or 41` `as the builder` 0 EQUALS months 0
#ASSERT `For how many months at most may I be imprisoned under ss 9, 37 or 41` `as the occupier` 2 EQUALS months 12
#ASSERT `For how many months at most may I be imprisoned under ss 9, 37 or 41` `as the owner` 0 EQUALS months (`What is the longest I can be imprisoned in months` 0)

-- s 133: building without a permit 5 years ago, yes (6 years); occupying without a permit 4 years ago, no (3 years);
-- the builder's notice of completion 2 years ago, yes (3 years). The builder's own s 37(1) offence 5 years ago, yes, and 7
-- years ago, no (s 133(3), 6 years); the builder's s 34(3) copy 2 years ago, yes, and 4 years ago, no (s 133(4), 3 years).
-- The baseline's four offences give the baseline's answers.
#ASSERT `Can I still be prosecuted for this offence` `as the owner` `I did building work without a building permit (s 9)` 5 EQUALS yes
#ASSERT `Can I still be prosecuted for this offence` `as the occupier` `I occupied or used a building without an occupancy permit (s 41)` 4 EQUALS no
#ASSERT `Can I still be prosecuted for this offence` `as the builder` `as the named builder, I did not give notice of completion in time (s 33)` 2 EQUALS yes
